              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1080,
                "end_index": 1282,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Seasonal \"Listen Free\" Events\nSeveral times a year, SiriusXM hosts **Free Listening Events** where they turn on inactive satellite radios in cars across North America\u2014no signup or credit card required"
