              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2123,
                "end_index": 2430,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Partner Deals (Up to 6 Months Free)\nBefore paying for a subscription, check your mobile carrier or hardware provider, as they frequently bundle free SiriusXM:\n* **T-Mobile:** Often offers eligible postpaid customers **6 months of free SiriusXM** streaming through the T-Life (formerly T-Mobile Tuesdays) app"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
