                "end_index": 3119,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**The Equipment:** You will need a satellite dish (a 30-to-35-inch dish for Ku-band signals in North America), a linear LNB (the receiving node on the dish arm), and an FTA satellite receiver connected to your home stereo or TV"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
